    <!-- How To Play -->
    <string name="title_how_to_play">SURVIVAL HANDBOOK</string>
    <string name="htp_intro">Greetings, warrior! Master these survival principles to endure the night in the monster forest:</string>
    <string name="guide_joystick_title">1. Intuitive 360° Floating Joystick</string>
    <string name="guide_joystick_desc">Touch anywhere on the left screen to spawn the dynamic floating joystick. Drag to steer around monsters and navigate terrain (trees, rocks, lakes). Release to halt immediately.</string>
    <string name="guide_weapons_title">2. Auto-Combat &amp; 4 Arsenal Weapons</string>
    <string name="guide_weapons_desc">Weapons automatically target and attack the nearest enemy. Equip up to 3 weapons simultaneously from: Holy Sword (melee cleave), Forest Bow (piercing arrows), Fireball (explosive blast), and Wrath Lightning (chain arcs). Normal tiers range 1 to 5.</string>
    <string name="guide_evolution_title">3. Mythic Weapon Evolution</string>
    <string name="guide_evolution_desc">When a weapon reaches Level 5, the next weapon chest unlocks EVOLUTION into a mythic master form: Blade Orbit (revolving blade shield), Arrow Storm (5-lane volley), Inferno Meteor (searing blast zone), or Thunder Web (arcing lightning network).</string>
    <string name="guide_skills_title">4. Tactical Skills: Dash &amp; Ultimate</string>
    <string name="guide_skills_desc">The Dash button (cyan icon) grants a swift dash with brief full invulnerability (iframes) to escape encirclement. The Ultimate button (gold icon) unleashes an energy shockwave that sweeps away enemy projectiles and knocks back nearby hordes.</string>
    <string name="guide_boxes_title">5. Battlefield Pickups &amp; Skill Chests</string>
    <string name="guide_boxes_desc">Collect Health Boxes (heal or boost Max HP), Damage Boxes, Speed Boxes, and Weapon Chests. Additionally, cyan Skill Chests spawn periodically, allowing you to level up Dash and Ultimate (reducing cooldown and amplifying power).</string>
    <string name="guide_night_title">6. Nightfall &amp; Monster Special Skills</string>
    <string name="guide_night_desc">At minute 5 (300s), night descends and narrows your field of vision. 67 monster species possess special skills: straight shots, fan bursts, poison, burn, slow, and slams. Always watch the red ground warning telegraphs to dodge in time!</string>
    <string name="guide_boss_title">7. Mini-Boss &amp; Lich Lord Final Boss</string>
    <string name="guide_boss_desc">At minute 5, a Mini-Boss emerges to test your mettle. At minute 9 (540s), the ancient Lich Lord awakens with 2 dangerous combat phases (including enrage) boasting immense vitality and lethal spells.</string>
    <string name="guide_win_title">8. Victory Conditions &amp; Endless Mode</string>
    <string name="guide_win_desc">SURVIVE PAST 10 MINUTES AND VANQUISH THE LICH LORD! Endure the full 10-minute battle (or 90 seconds in Demo mode) and slay the final boss to claim glorious victory. In Endless mode, test your ultimate survival limits and hunt down as many Boss waves as possible!</string>

